// The TYPE a suffix names, as a `TY_*` kind.
//
// TY_INVALID for a suffix whose type has no kind yet -- the `frac`
// widths are REAL types arriving at a later rung (1.3.5), and the
// caller names the rung rather than pretending the suffix is absent
